/-! # Kerr–Newman (Boyer–Lindquist): parameter tangents (ATLAS-IV-03)

Data `gKN M a Q`, `giKN M a Q`, `faradayKN a Q`, `domReg M a Q = {Σ ≠ 0, Δ ≠ 0, sin θ ≠ 0}` of IV-02,
unchanged. For every real `M, a, Q` and every direction `(m, α, q)` (mass, rotation, charge, or any real
combination; `a = 0`, `Q = 0` allowed, no division by `a` or `Q`):

* the actual family `ε ↦ (gKN (M+εm) (a+εα) (Q+εq), giKN …, faradayKN (a+εα) (Q+εq))` is a `FamilyData`
  on the **open** set `domJ = {(ε, y) | y ∈ domReg (M+εm) (a+εα) (Q+εq)}` (parameter-dependent regular set;
  no uniform `ε`-interval over the noncompact exterior is claimed);
* every member is certified by `certReg` (no derivative of the horizon cut `rPlus` is taken);
* hence (`param_tangent`) its genuine tangent `paramTangent` (componentwise `ε`-derivative at `0`, a true
  `HasDerivAt` by `isTangent_paramTangent`) satisfies `LE = LJ = LH = 0` at every `x ∈ domReg M a Q`, and
  (`param_tangent_exterior`) on the BL exterior `domKN M a Q` when `0 < M`. -/

open Real
open scoped ContDiff
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.KN

namespace ExactVacuumAtlas.Variation.KN

/-- Parameter-dependent regular domain in `ℝ × ℝ⁴`. -/
def domJ (M a Q m α q : ℝ) : Set (ℝ × Pt 4) :=
  {p | p.2 ∈ domReg (M + p.1 * m) (a + p.1 * α) (Q + p.1 * q)}

end ExactVacuumAtlas.Variation.KN


